          "default": "[](const FCustomDestinationParams& Params, FVector& OutputPoint"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TUniqueFunction<",
      "docs": "If ShouldUseCustomDestinationFunc() returns true, this function is used to get a destination point, and\nthe output parameters are picked in such a way that the axis origin moves to the closest point in the plane\nto the destination point.\nUsed, for instance, for aligning to items in the scene."
